     r2SCAN-3c: A 'Swiss army knife' composite electronic-structure method
     J. Chem. Phys. 2021 154 , 064103
     doi.org/10.1063/5.0040021
  2. Neese, F.
     Software update: the ORCA program system, version 6.0
